	<ouc:div label="main-content" group="Everyone" button-text="Main Content"><ouc:editor csspath="/_resources/ou/editor/wysiwyg.css" cssmenu="/_resources/ou/editor/styles.txt" wysiwyg-class="main-content"/><p><img src="{{f:66652232}}" alt="2024 ccc culinary bootcamp" width="1080" height="811" /></p>
<hr />
<p>The California Conservation Corps Culinary Bootcamp at Lake Tahoe Community College is an immersive, four-day, hands-on training program designed to equip participants with essential culinary skills. Nestled in the scenic environment of Lake Tahoe, the bootcamp offers a unique blend of practical instruction and real-world experience, fostering a dynamic learning environment. Participants, including Corpsmembers, engage in comprehensive coursework that covers a wide range of culinary techniques.</p>
<p>The course is designed to prepare participants for entry-level prep cook positions in the local culinary industry and foster a seamless transition into credit courses and programs.</p>
<hr />
<p><span style="font-size: 24px;">Confidence in the Kitchen</span></p>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<p>Organization and Terminology</p>
<ul>
<li>Equipment overview and use</li>
<li>Kitchen station expectations</li>
<li>Weights and measurements</li>
</ul>
</td>
<td>
<p>Sanitation and Safety</p>
<ul>
<li>Personal hygiene</li>
<li>Proper kitchen attire</li>
